        <mxCell id="c22" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12.5px&quot;&gt;Execution profiles&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;make deploy: Deploy the bundle to $(TARGET)&lt;br&gt;make run: Trigger a refresh of a pipeline on $(TARGET) (PIPELINE=&amp;lt;resource&amp;gt;, default customer_sales_etl)&lt;br&gt;make run-local: Materialize the medallion locally on sample data — spark-pipelines run&lt;br&gt;make validate-connect: Validate one dataset on a LIVE cluster via isolated Databricks Connect" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D2DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="724" width="420" height="154" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c23" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12.5px&quot;&gt;Environment operations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;make bootstrap-uc: Print/apply UC bootstrap SQL for $(TARGET) (WAREHOUSE_ID=… to apply; PROFILE=… picks the workspace; SKIP_CATALOGS=1 if catalogs exist)&lt;br&gt;make validate: databricks bundle validate -t $(TARGET)&lt;br&gt;make destroy: Tear down everything the bundle deployed to $(TARGET) (asks first)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D2DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="484" y="724" width="420" height="138" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c24" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12.5px&quot;&gt;Repository gates&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;make check-design: Fail if design/PIPELINES.md or design/*.drawio is stale, hand-edited, or fails the layout audit (CI)&lt;br&gt;make check-skills: Fail if the .claude/skills copy drifted from .agents/skills (CI + pre-commit)&lt;br&gt;make check-lockstep: Fail if the datalab git tag, var.datalab_version, uv.lock and framework-doc links disagree" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D2DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=14;spacingTop=12;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="928" y="724" width="420" height="138" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
